## Quick Start

### 1. Install dependencies

```sh
npm install
```

### 2. Configure environment variables

Copy `.env.example` to `.env.local` and fill in the values (see `docs/ENVIRONMENT.md` if `devops.environments` has run).

{{#if project.hasDatabase}}
### 3. Set up the database

```sh
npm run dbGenerate
npm run dbMigrate
```
{{/if}}

### {{#if project.hasDatabase}}4{{else}}3{{/if}}. Run

```sh
npm run dev
```

For a production-style local run:

```sh
npm run build
npm start
```
<!-- END QUICK START -->
